[31m+      * each jamb, the slab laid back toward its hinge — swung[39m
[31m+      * ~105° into the hall, so each leaf runs diagonally into the[39m
[31m+      * hall from its jamb and the doorway reads OPEN from the[39m
[31m+      * plaza. The hinges sit on the gold jambs (x ±2.24, inside[39m
[31m+      * the jamb span 2.2..2.4), so even the leaves' hinge corners[39m
[31m+      * stay at |x| ≥ 2.19 — outside the arch portal (|x| ≤ 2.15)[39m
