[31m+    never by look, so a theme re-skin re-uses what's already loaded.[39m
[31m+    Repeats come from repeatForSize (metres, not vibes — item 7) and[39m
[31m+    wrapping is plain Repeat: the source is made tileable at load by[39m
[31m+    pbr-materials.enhanceLoadedTexture (item 11), which also derives[39m
