[31m+   /* ── Water round 2 helpers (Stack-100 #2 items 5–7) ──────────[39m
[31m+    * Every water surface in the world is built the same way: the[39m
[31m+    * look's water colour texture (cloned, scrolled by the tick)[39m
[31m+    * PLUS a cloned ripple normal texture the same tick counter-[39m
[31m+    * scrolls — the surface bends light, not just slides a picture.[39m
[31m+    * And every basin wears the wet edge: a dark band on the water[39m
